---
description: RTL studio visual and interaction contract
globs: "**/*.{tsx,ts,js,css,html,svg}"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Arabic navigation stays right; support expanded, compact and closed states.
- Use a draggable/resizable window manager with minimize, maximize, restore and keyboard access.
- Keep graph world coordinates separate from floating window screen coordinates.
- Preserve ancestors, stable node IDs and pinned positions across expansion.
- Abstract luminous supervisor core, not a corporate logo circle.
- DOM text remains readable; decorative light must not create fake business edges.
- Capture the correct reference composition and state at a fixed viewport.
- Generated storyboard references require storyboard renders, not a single state screenshot.

